Description: GH-17787: a stream of getStream() borrows the zip_t of the archive; freeing the ZipArchive while the stream was open closed the archive under it (a short read, the pending changes lost); the stream keeps the archive alive now (PHP 8.4.26, not in this branch); brought onto getStream() and php_stream_zip_open() of 8.1, which has no getStreamIndex() and getStreamName(); its test with getStream() only; its tests taken
Origin: php-src commit 5a326b9a432a8d7df6f814692391bbda15eeff4c (Eyüp Can Akman, 14.08.2026, PHP 8.4.26)

